      "La fibra de un mineroducto en operación registró un sismo Mw 4.6; las ondas P y S se detectaron automáticamente con PhaseNet.": "The fiber of an operating slurry pipeline recorded an Mw 4.6 earthquake; the P and S waves were picked automatically with PhaseNet.",
      "Unos 2 km de fibra enterrada en un volcán activo: perfil del subsuelo con ruido ambiental, en procesamiento, y registro de emanaciones de gases.": "About 2 km of fiber buried on an active volcano: a subsurface profile from ambient noise, still being processed, and records of gas emissions.",
      "Despliegue DAS en un ambiente volcánico e hidrotermal, junto a la University of Washington (abril 2026).": "DAS deployment in a volcanic and hydrothermal setting, with the University of Washington (April 2026).",
      "Ver detalle →": "See details →",
